# Coverage artefacts. A 52 KB SQLite file holding absolute local paths; it was
# committed into four of these repositories the day coverage was first measured.
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
coverage.xml

# The raw thousand-package census: 540 KB, because every arm carries the full list of
# tests it named. docs/census-summary.json is the committed reduction of it, and that is
# what the README's census figures and tests/test_census_numbers.py read. Regenerate the
# raw file with scripts/third_party_census.py and the summary with scripts/census_summary.py.
docs/third-party-census.json
docs/*-census.json.poisoned
